# Phase 4 fix: what the F4 overlay's Save (save_config here) writes into mcla.toml after frame
# generation was turned on: only real settings (frame_generation), none of the presenter's status.
# Run with --toml <a file with one line> and compare it with mcla.toml.after in the run folder.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark settle
wait 3s
get frame_generation fg_status
set frame_generation fsr
wait 3s
get frame_generation fg_status
save_config
wait 1s
set frame_generation off
wait 1s
mark end
wait 1s
